dinner when in town. But this camaraderie doesn=E2=80=99t prevent a burning=
 desire to drive each other off the track when a golden belt is at stake.</=
p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Luckily for Jarman, he wasn=E2=80=99t the onl=
y one who froze. He settled down and finished second at the competition. Ov=
er the next few months, hunched at a laptop even while on holiday, he prepa=
red for the 2024 world championship. He wanted that darn belt.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">This year, with the 2025 Microsoft Excel Worl=
d Championships set to take place in December, Jarman has to worry about mo=
re than Excel guys. A new contender threatens to spell the end for not just=
 professional Excel competitors but also office workers who specialize in E=
xcel in millions of offices across the world.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">It=E2=80=99s AI. And, unlike Jarman, it doesn=
=E2=80=99t tend to freeze.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><strong>The weird and wonderful world of comp=
etitive Excel</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Elite athletes hate losing. The world of comp=
etitive Microsoft Excel is no different. Just ask Jarman=E2=80=99s wife.</p=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">On their second date, at a boardgame cafe, Ja=
rman told her that =E2=80=9Che wouldn=E2=80=99t just let her win to be nice=
.=E2=80=9D And he didn=E2=80=99t.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">It was at university where Jarman, who=E2=80=
=99s now 30 and lives in Toronto, first developed a reputation as an Excel =
savant. Then, while working as an analyst at the project finance firm Operi=
s, his daily life revolved around the software. He accumulated thousands of=
 hours tinkering with spreadsheets, climbing to a director position at Oper=
is.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">One of his bosses suggested he check out the =
competitive Microsoft Excel space, a deeply niche set of tournaments focuse=
d on solving real-life financial modeling cases, such as forecasting the am=
ount of money fans might spend at a tournament or building a three-statemen=
t model for a manufacturing company. Jarman would have some initial success=
, winning <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWyS=
sF7CZgnXW3xydQk7GQhy7W46ZLVZ5GcxdfMBB8SM2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3kwN81dh01CwGHLW92y0=
