<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Over time, the contests would evolve into a f=
ull-blown eSport: The Microsoft Excel World Championship, launched in 2021,=
 focuses on solving cases that are =E2=80=9Csexier=E2=80=9D than, say, mode=
