</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">He considers himself to be =E2=80=9Csufficien=
tly senior=E2=80=9D to charge roughly the same in a world with AI.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Jarman=E2=80=99s unconvinced, too. =E2=80=9CI=
t's not just about being good at Excel. It=E2=80=99s about a combination of=
 being good at Excel but also being able to look at the spreadsheet, spot w=
here things are wrong, and be able to stitch different pieces together.=E2=
=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CI don=E2=80=99t think an AI will eve=
r be as good as me or another director here [at Operus] who=E2=80=99s compe=
tent at Excel with 10-15 years of experience,=E2=80=9D he adds.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">But the same might not be true for everyone.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><strong>Excel monkeys</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Earlier this year, the team behind the startu=
p Shortcut AI, dubbed as a =E2=80=9Csuperhuman Excel agent,=E2=80=9D <a hre=
f=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWySsF7CZgnXW3xydQk7=
GQhy7W46ZLVZ5GcxdfMBB8TF6Y2WnW7lD3J86lZ3nMW5GHHf76FwRmSW73GpxL4RqMZ0W4XymPf=
