a McKinsey or Goldman Sachs analyst <strong>89.1%</strong> of the time, and=
 do it <strong>10x</strong> faster.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">This was no Microsoft Copilot. This was a too=
