Shortcut AI could replace young analysts who lacked the skill of Excel worl=
d champions.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Jarman, though, doesn't think that it=E2=80=
=99s prudent to fire your first-year analyst class.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CIf we sacked all the analysts tomorr=
ow, the company would immediately be more profitable,=E2=80=9D he says. =E2=
=80=9CBut that would be dumb, because who would then check the work of the =
AI in five to ten years time?=E2=80=9D</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></t=
