<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Indeed, even though AI might be an upgrade on=
 a junior analyst, there are longer term implications to getting rid of new=
er talent. The entry-level roles aren=E2=80=99t just about immediate gains;=
 they're about identifying and developing future leaders.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Further, it=E2=80=99s only by doing the =E2=
=80=9Cmonkey work=E2=80=9D to build something that one can truly understand=
 it.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CUntil you have built a three-stateme=
nt model for the first time, you don=E2=80=99t intuitively understand the p=
oint of what you=E2=80=99re trying to do,=E2=80=9D Jarman says.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">But we don=E2=80=99t have to look too far to =
find an example of technology replacing workers: When Excel first came out =
in the 1980s, a <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf0=
4/VWySsF7CZgnXW3xydQk7GQhy7W46ZLVZ5GcxdfMBB8Vx2-Z-MW95jsWP6lZ3l1W77-TT64sbc=
