<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Under this view, a leap in AI might just rais=
e the bar: clients will expect more complex models, longer decks, and deepe=
r analysis.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CThere are probably more people worki=
ng on analyzing data now than there were 40 years ago, even though one pers=
on can do what a team of 50 could do back then,=E2=80=9D Early says.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">In a similar scenario, AI might augment rathe=
r than automate. But there=E2=80=99s no guarantee that it doesn=E2=80=99t g=
et worse before it gets better.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><strong>The next formula</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">As the 2024 Excel championship neared its end=
, Jarman anxiously watched the countdown timer on a big screen. With about =
15 seconds to go, his opponent, Ngai, threw a hail mary, using the RANDBETW=
EEN function to attempt an educated guess that could score the 50 points he=
 needed to catch up to Jarman.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">It didn=E2=80=99t work. The belt went from Au=
stralia to Canada, from Ngai to Jarman.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">When the clock reached zero seconds, Jarman l=
eaped out of his chair. You could hear his huge sigh of relief, immediately=
 followed by a triumphant =E2=80=9CCOME ON!=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The belt was finally his.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The same tournament where Microsoft had shown=
 off its AI assistant was still, ultimately, a contest of human instinct an=
d nerve. But the tide had turned.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
