2vHjkW2w2GK762JJYdW3G0tF27B5LcjW5cF2qN3RmWBBW3jqZ625zPftNVPQrLq8jKzf2W3S_vR=
p6zM8MsW84qdvZ5GqGMQW8fMx9J3dsk38f9lRrtz04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"UMhzobY9" target=3D"_blank">banned</a>=
 their use entirely. Until recently, competitors were allowed to use whatev=
er software they liked =E2=80=94 including AI =E2=80=94 because it simply w=
asn=E2=80=99t fast or accurate enough to compete with humans.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">That=E2=80=99s no longer true. Shortcut <a hr=
